{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34447","headline":"和袭美寒日书斋即事三首每篇各用一韵 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寒日书斋即事三首每篇各用一韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已上星津八月槎，文通犹自学丹砂。\n仙经写得空三洞，隐士招来别九华。\n静对真图呼绿齿，偶开神室问黄芽。\n方诸更是怜才子，锡赉於君合有差。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}